; The accounts subsystem: Meteor-style identity hard-wired into Fennec — users, signed-cookie
; sessions, passwords/email/MFA/passkeys, OAuth/OIDC/SAML/SCIM, orgs + RBAC. Persistence rides the
; fennec-mongo backends (minimongo / Burrow / mongod, one backend-blind store); the HTTP surface
; (DDP methods, OAuth/SAML endpoints, session cookies) is built on fennec-paw. The native I/O shell,
; middleware battery, websockets, TLS/ACME and host routing live in the standalone fennec-paw library.
; Contributor entry point + the declarative-config DX: ./README.md.
;
; This library is the engine + store + HTTP + facade; the pure, HTTP-free / store-free logic lives in
; two leaf sub-libs (fennec.accounts.primitives, fennec.accounts.features). [accounts.ml] is a thin
; facade satisfying [accounts.mli]; [accounts_base.ml] glues the engine in dependency order:
;   types → secrets (crypto VERBATIM) → identity_bridge → runtime (make/hooks/audit) → request (the
;   cookie paw + RBAC guards) → lifecycle (writes) → login (sessions/login flows) → http (*_paw routes)
; then: native (Store + the process singleton + Wiring), methods (the DDP Methods functor), session
; (the HTTP session-view), provider_presets (the OAuth/OIDC/SAML one-liners), profile (typed profile),
; codec/collection_store (the storage plumbing), mailer (the templated emails).
; Inline let%test ride with each module; the engine-integration + HTTP/DDP-system suite is the dedicated
; accounts_integration_test.ml (its fixture sits at the store layer, above the engine leaves).

(library
 (name fennec_accounts)
 (public_name fennec.accounts)
 ; fennec-paw: the HTTP toolkit accounts builds its endpoints + session middleware on.
 ; x509 + the crypto stack (mirage-crypto via x509, zarith, digestif, base64): token/cert
 ; handling for passkeys / OIDC / SAML. zlib + bigstringaf: SAML deflate. fennec.mail +
 ; fennec.fur: the templated verification / reset emails.
 (libraries
  fennec.accounts.primitives
  fennec.accounts.features
  fennec-paw
  fennec-mongo.bson
  fennec-mongo.bson_json
  ; fennec.pulse.sift: the typed-BSON codec ['p Sift.t] behind the OPTIONAL typed [user.profile]
  ; (Accounts.profile_codec / typed_profile / set_typed_profile). Pure + jsoo-safe, bson-only — it
  ; adds no heavy / non-prod-lean dep (only the bson/json trees accounts already links).
  fennec.pulse.sift
  fennec-mongo.minimongo
  fennec-mongo.driver
  fennec-mongo.backend
  fennec-mongo.dynamic
  fennec-mongo.json
  fennec.mail
  fennec.fur
  unix
  digestif
  base64
  zlib
  bigstringaf
  x509
  zarith
  ptime
  mirage-crypto-rng.unix
  fennec-hunt.unit
  fennec-hunt.prop)
 (inline_tests
  (backend fennec-hunt.runner))
 (preprocess
  (pps fennec-hunt.ppx)))
